# The build context of the Dockerfile, whose build stage bind-mounts this
# directory and compiles the workspace (crates/, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock,
# wit/). Everything else is sent to the daemon for nothing, and the build
# outputs and caches below weigh gigabytes: the workspace's target/, the
# worktrees under .claude/ with target directories of their own, the pinned
# tools, the end-to-end suite's output, the examples with their toolchains'
# caches, the documentation site.
.git
.claude
.cache
_output
.work
book
target
**/target
build
docs
examples
package
test
.github
*.xpkg
